@startuml coupon-register-auto-activity
title 新用户注册自动发放优惠券

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName "PingFang SC, Microsoft YaHei, sans-serif"
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #94A3B8
  DiamondBackgroundColor #F0F9FF
  DiamondBorderColor #3B82F6
  StartColor #16A34A
  EndColor #EF4444
  ArrowColor #475569
}
skinparam swimlane {
  BackgroundColor #F8FAFC
  BorderColor #CBD5E1
  TitleBackgroundColor #E2E8F0
}

|用户服务|

start

:用户完成注册;

:发布注册事件;

|消息队列|

:投递注册事件;

|优惠券服务|

:消费注册事件;

:匹配自动发放模板;

if (存在匹配模板?) then (否)
  :不发放;
  stop
else (是)
endif

:发放落库;

|数据库|

:写入用户券与状态流水;

stop

@enduml
